{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Forgot</strong> is a short anomaly hunting horror game. You play as a boy who is imprisoned at home with his grandparents. But is this really your home and are you sure those are your grandparents?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You want to leave, but no exit leads to the outside. The rooms are looping endlessly and time seems to be standing still. It is midnight and &quot;grandmother&quot; won't let you leave before the morning. She keeps feeding you cake and sends you back to your room. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sometimes your surroundings change and sometimes they stay the same... Look out for anomalies and make a decision:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Are there anomalies at home?</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The cake is poisoned, do <strong>NOT</strong> eat it and leave immediately!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Does everything look normal?</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The cake is <strong>safe</strong>\u00a0and delicious, make sure to eat it on your way out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Only if you make <strong>12</strong> correct decisions in a row, the morning will come and the path to freedom will open.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Playtime: 15 - 60 minutes</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1558800?t=1746460073","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1558800?t=1746460073","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1558800/05690d6a0e1cff83de7b044ddd2b313a84166b85/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746460073","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1558800/05690d6a0e1cff83de7b044ddd2b313a84166b85/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746460073","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Blood and severed body parts"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Forgot</strong> is a short anomaly hunting horror game. You play as a boy who is imprisoned at home with his grandparents. But is this really your home and are you sure those are your grandparents?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You want to leave, but no exit leads to the outside. The rooms are looping endlessly and time seems to be standing still. It is midnight and &quot;grandmother&quot; won't let you leave before the morning. She keeps feeding you cake and sends you back to your room. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sometimes your surroundings change and sometimes they stay the same... Look out for anomalies and make a decision:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Are there anomalies at home?</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The cake is poisoned, do <strong>NOT</strong> eat it and leave immediately!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Does everything look normal?</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The cake is <strong>safe</strong>\u00a0and delicious, make sure to eat it on your way out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Only if you make <strong>12</strong> correct decisions in a row, the morning will come and the path to freedom will open.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Playtime: 15 - 60 minutes</i></p>","developers":["Maxwell Whitebaker"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1558800/58036b4ec01560ee0622fe7562918d1324db69cf/header.jpg?t=1746460073","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Forgot","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-6700<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA RTX 3060/AMD Radeon RX 6700XT series or higher<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Maxwell Whitebaker"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia Extrema\nMedo","rating":"16","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"16","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Drastische Gewalt","rating":"18","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"18","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"2025"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1558800/e06c4e7ecdf671d1155b0fd657d54dec6c551b95/ss_e06c4e7ecdf671d1155b0fd657d54dec6c551b95.1920x1080.jpg?t=1746460073","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1558800/e06c4e7ecdf671d1155b0fd657d54dec6c551b95/ss_e06c4e7ecdf671d1155b0fd657d54dec6c551b95.600x338.jpg?t=1746460073"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1558800/fc509d8b08c705cfb7bdff2fac288c98d6ad35b8/ss_fc509d8b08c705cfb7bdff2fac288c98d6ad35b8.1920x1080.jpg?t=1746460073","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1558800/fc509d8b08c705cfb7bdff2fac288c98d6ad35b8/ss_fc509d8b08c705cfb7bdff2fac288c98d6ad35b8.600x338.jpg?t=1746460073"},{"id":2,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1558800/19e3bd829f0123e44f8ac03e9990d2bf56637985/ss_19e3bd829f0123e44f8ac03e9990d2bf5663798